{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROLOGUE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congratulations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have passed the selection among many candidates and have been accepted for the position of Night Administrator at Motel <i>Horizon</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/5f8ed3317bb916088b0916839971b66e.poster.avif?t=1766252835\" width=1030 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/5f8ed3317bb916088b0916839971b66e.webm?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/5f8ed3317bb916088b0916839971b66e.mp4?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first working day, you are brought to the motel office, where you learn that you must complete 14 shifts, and that the motel follows mandatory \u201cRules\u201d that must be obeyed no matter how strange or absurd they may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8408b67ab49acd88a0d6b2dc30aaaf9d.poster.avif?t=1766252835\" width=1030 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8408b67ab49acd88a0d6b2dc30aaaf9d.webm?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8408b67ab49acd88a0d6b2dc30aaaf9d.mp4?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should also know that not all Rules are known, and some of them you will have to discover on your own - sometimes at the cost of your own life. Always stay cautious and pay attention to any unusual events happening at Motel <i>Horizon</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/621d56191af8f0e54ce66652478d401c.poster.avif?t=1766252835\" width=1030 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/621d56191af8f0e54ce66652478d401c.webm?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/621d56191af8f0e54ce66652478d401c.mp4?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out your direct duties as a motel administrator - serve visitors, complete assignments, and maintain cleanliness and order, but most importantly - FOLLOW THE RULES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something goes wrong, the company will, let\u2019s just say\u2026 hire another Night Administrator who will handle the assigned position better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/a9320d7d32b82a254bf2ba5b3ba42a73.poster.avif?t=1766252835\" width=1030 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/a9320d7d32b82a254bf2ba5b3ba42a73.webm?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/a9320d7d32b82a254bf2ba5b3ba42a73.mp4?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive all shifts and uncover what - or who - is behind Motel <i>Horizon</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Psst\u2026 Don\u2019t trust them! They\u2019re only pretending to be human!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of possible endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different actions can trigger both positive and negative effects that influence the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigating visitors and the environment using various devices \u2014 unlocking new gameplay possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dialogue system with unique structure and specificity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of character reactions to the player\u2019s actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item management and trading with the Company\u2019s representative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participation in the activities of various factions, such as the Company, the Church, and the Cult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story with roguelike elements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156680?t=1766252835","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/8025fd6d014f7feb550e49264a19907d436ce0b3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766252835","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/43e315a48e2f3ebc23bac71264b6f7a24a8fae85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766252835","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/43e315a48e2f3ebc23bac71264b6f7a24a8fae85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766252835","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROLOGUE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Congratulations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have passed the selection among many candidates and have been accepted for the position of Night Administrator at Motel <i>Horizon</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/5f8ed3317bb916088b0916839971b66e.poster.avif?t=1766252835\" width=1030 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/5f8ed3317bb916088b0916839971b66e.webm?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/5f8ed3317bb916088b0916839971b66e.mp4?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first working day, you are brought to the motel office, where you learn that you must complete 14 shifts, and that the motel follows mandatory \u201cRules\u201d that must be obeyed no matter how strange or absurd they may seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8408b67ab49acd88a0d6b2dc30aaaf9d.poster.avif?t=1766252835\" width=1030 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8408b67ab49acd88a0d6b2dc30aaaf9d.webm?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/extras/8408b67ab49acd88a0d6b2dc30aaaf9d.mp4?t=1766252835\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should also know that not all Rules are known, and some of them you will have to discover on your own - sometimes at the cost of your own life. Always stay cautious and pay attention to any unusual events happening at Motel <i>Horizon</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_im