p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different actions can trigger both positive and negative effects that influence the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigating visitors and the environment using various devices \u2014 unlocking new gameplay possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching dialogue system with unique structure and specificity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of character reactions to the player\u2019s actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item management and trading with the Company\u2019s representative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participation in the activities of various factions, such as the Company, the Church, and the Cult</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story with roguelike elements</p></li></ul>","developers":["OutNord Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156680/9e63d93fb5994b2d7fa2a46e5ca13d22a69f1bc2/header.jpg?t=1766252835","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156680/1813809103/23ec5118f0fe1f5d1b8c27f2c61b20e866754aca/1766179950/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766182014","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156680/1813809103/23ec5118f0fe1f5d1b8c27f2c61b20e866754aca/1766179950/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766182014","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156680/1813809103/23ec5118f0fe1f5d1b8c27f2c61b20e866754aca/1766179950/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766182014","id":257252956,"name":"Rules: Motel Horizon - Official Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257252956/4494e820a2002020abd7db8bcf2d31a9876e63b4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766182014"}],"name":"Rules: Motel Horizon","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<st